<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange finished higher in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 33.48 to a record 6600.66.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.62 to 396.90.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.27.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1483 to 1030.</p>
<p>Volume was 538,207,220 compared with 527,105,420 Monday.</p>
